{"session": {"id": "145ab7dc-3524-4829-8b44-d4e3d340a34c", "tenantId": "018f3d00-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "siteId": "01a14000-1000-7000-8000-000000000001", "agentDefinitionId": "operations-investigation.v1", "createdBy": "01a13920-9822-71ff-af68-023cb79317fe", "revision": 1, "status": "COMPLETED", "activeRunId": null, "createdAt": 1792234732777, "updatedAt": 1792234739317}, "runs": [{"id": "b32a7346-ae47-490b-bd9a-3f1c7e4ce8dd", "sessionId": "145ab7dc-3524-4829-8b44-d4e3d340a34c", "modelRef": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-flash"}, "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": 1792234732777, "finishedAt": 1792234739317, "usage": {"inputTokens": 5589, "outputTokens": 1288, "modelCalls": 3, "toolCalls": 3}, "failureCode": null}], "messages": [{"id": "418b74a9-3bda-42cb-8463-ac3cc64952fd", "sessionId": "145ab7dc-3524-4829-8b44-d4e3d340a34c", "runId": null, "role": "OPERATOR", "content": "10月13日到10月16日每天峰、平、谷各时段的电费分别是多少？", "createdAt": 1792234732777}, {"id": "message-b32a7346-ae47-490b-bd9a-3f1c7e4ce8dd-2", "sessionId": "145ab7dc-3524-4829-8b44-d4e3d340a34c", "runId": "b32a7346-ae47-490b-bd9a-3f1c7e4ce8dd", "role": "ASSISTANT", "content": "四天里每天只出现了峰、平、谷三个电价时段，没有尖峰时段的电费记录。\n\n**结论：10月13日至16日各时段电度电费（元，仅有效数据、只含电度电费，不含需量电费）**\n\n| 日期 | 峰 | 平 | 谷 | 当日合计 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 10月13日 | 773.28 | 556.04 | 28.82 | 约 1358.14 |\n| 10月14日 | 521.55 | 458.86 | 28.15 | 约 1008.56 |\n| 10月15日 | 610.79 | 574.12 | 27.60 | 约 1212.51 |\n| 10月16日 | 682.89 | 447.02 | 27.60 | 约 1157.51 |\n\n**依据**：在同一个按日统计、并按电价时段拆分的站点电费估算视图中，各时段对应的已计价电量如下：\n- 10月13日：峰 750.759 度，平 896.844 度，谷 120.091 度\n- 10月14日：峰 506.359 度，平 740.101 度，谷 117.275 度\n- 10月15日：峰 593 度，平 926 度，谷 115 度\n- 10月16日：峰 663 度，平 721 度，谷 115 度\n\n**几点观察**\n- 四天里峰段电费最高的是 10月13日（773.28 元，峰段电量也最大）；平段电量最高的是 10月15日（926 度）。\n- 谷段电量四天都很稳定，在 115～120 度，因此谷段电费基本保持在 28 元左右。\n- 未计价电量四天都为空，说明这四天的电量全部有电价覆盖，电费估算没有遗漏。\n\n**局限**：电费为按站点分时电价计算的估算电度电费，正式账单以结算为准；不含需量电费。四天均没有尖峰时段记录（可能该站未设尖峰电价时段）。", "createdAt": 1792234734966}], "toolExecutions": [{"id": "call_00_adKBStdsA7Xx77sVX6hV9517", "sessionId": "145ab7dc-3524-4829-8b44-d4e3d340a34c", "runId": "b32a7346-ae47-490b-bd9a-3f1c7e4ce8dd", "toolName": "site_get_context", "argumentsDigest": "44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": 1792234733644, "finishedAt": 1792234733667, "resultSummary": "Tool completed.", "provenance": [], "failureCode": null}, {"id": "call_00_KVcP3r1KmW6uVcGoSRMf4281", "sessionId": "145ab7dc-3524-4829-8b44-d4e3d340a34c", "runId": "b32a7346-ae47-490b-bd9a-3f1c7e4ce8dd", "toolName": "energy_semantic_query", "argumentsDigest": "0d57bfae8a53967a38f9762605768c9388d1e012e0590f2ecb2b4755b8d7f5e8", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": 1792234734747, "finishedAt": 1792234734964, "resultSummary": "Tool completed.", "provenance": [], "failureCode": null}, {"id": "call_00_1qenTp0wz3RifIf5T6uY4140", "sessionId": "145ab7dc-3524-4829-8b44-d4e3d340a34c", "runId": "b32a7346-ae47-490b-bd9a-3f1c7e4ce8dd", "toolName": "investigation_complete", "argumentsDigest": "df4ac2686efd07025a4d53a9b9a389db7a3a5aeb45e1030a669802ef268ff361", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": 1792234739315, "finishedAt": 1792234739317, "resultSummary": "Tool completed.", "provenance": [{"owner": "ENERGY", "resourceId": "松雅轩:2026-10-13..2026-10-16", "resourceType": "site_energy_cost_daily_by_tariff", "toolExecutionId": "call_00_KVcP3r1KmW6uVcGoSRMf4281"}, {"owner": "REGISTRY", "resourceId": "01a14000-1000-7000-8000-000000000001", "resourceType": "site", "toolExecutionId": "call_00_adKBStdsA7Xx77sVX6hV9517"}], "failureCode": null}], "artifacts": [{"id": "artifact-call_00_1qenTp0wz3RifIf5T6uY4140", "kind": "FINDING", "runId": "b32a7346-ae47-490b-bd9a-3f1c7e4ce8dd", "finding": {"outcome": "SUPPORTED_FINDING", "keyFigures": [{"unit": "元", "label": "10/13峰段电费", "value": "773.28"}, {"unit": "元", "label": "10/15平段电费", "value": "574.12"}, {"unit": "元", "label": "谷段电费（每日）", "value": "27.6~28.8"}, {"unit": "元", "label": "四天电费合计", "value"